---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Pricing — TPM">
  <section style="padding: 3rem 0 2rem;">
    <h1>Pricing</h1>
    <p style="color: #4d4d4d; max-width: 40rem;">
      Simple per-audit economics. Everything includes unlimited re-runs, PDF + HTML prototypes, and the
      full six-stage pipeline.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;">
    <div class="plan" style="border: 1px solid #e4e4e0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Free</h2>
      <p class="price" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.5rem 0;">$0</p>
      <ul>
        <li>1 lifetime full audit</li>
        <li>Unlimited quick audits on repos you've audited</li>
        <li>Markdown output</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/docs" class="button secondary">Read docs</a>
    </div>
    <div class="plan" style="border: 2px solid #0654ba; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Pro</h2>
      <p class="price" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.5rem 0;">$20<span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4d4d4d;">/month</span></p>
      <ul>
        <li>20 full audits / month</li>
        <li>Unlimited re-runs</li>
        <li>PDF + HTML prototypes</li>
        <li>Audit history sync</li>
        <li>Custom patterns per project (v2)</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/upgrade?tier=pro" class="button">Start Pro</a>
    </div>
    <div class="plan" style="border: 1px solid #e4e4e0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Team</h2>
      <p class="price" style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.5rem 0;">$49<span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4d4d4d;">/seat/month</span></p>
      <ul>
        <li>50 full audits / seat / month</li>
        <li>Shared custom pattern library</li>
        <li>Shared audit history across org</li>
        <li>Org-level audit trends</li>
        <li>CI integration (v2)</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/upgrade?tier=team" class="button">Contact team sales</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e0;">
    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <details>
      <summary><strong>What counts as a "full audit"?</strong></summary>
      <p>A full audit runs all six pipeline stages end-to-end and produces spec.md + spec.pdf + prototypes. Quick audits skip stages C-F — they're the recon half.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><strong>Does TPM see my source code?</strong></summary>
      <p>TPM runs on your machine. It sends only the specific prompts needed to the Workers AI proxy — not the full repo. Prompts are logged server-side as metadata (tokens, model, session) not content, unless you opt in to debug mode.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><strong>Can I cancel anytime?</strong></summary>
      <p>Yes — one click in the Stripe billing portal (<code>tpm account</code>). No email-to-cancel friction.</p>
    </details>
  </section>
</Base>
